<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This is the best-in-slot gear available from all PvE sources before entering a raid. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
