<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c3" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Beast Mastery Hunters</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria Classic brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. This includes Rare mobs, like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50787/arness-the-scale">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Arness the Scale</span></a>, but also World Bosses, such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak-the-storm-lord">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c3" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak The Storm Lord</span></h3>Nalak, like Sha of Anger, drops Normal mode (ilvl 522) Tier 15 Legs and Gloves, as well as Tyrannical Gladiator's pieces.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95256/saurok-stalkers-gloves">
<img alt="Saurok Stalker's Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_mail_raidhunter_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Saurok Stalker's Gloves</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95258/saurok-stalkers-legguards">
<img alt="Saurok Stalker's Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_mail_raidhunter_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Saurok Stalker's Legguards</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c3" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>Oondasta on the Isle of Thunder, drops ilvl 522 pieces, many of them are relevant early especially for Pre-Bis gearing.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95179/necklace-of-the-hazillosaurus">
<img alt="Necklace of the Hazillosaurus" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_125.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of the Hazillosaurus</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95149/gorgoraptor-scale-chest">
<img alt="Gorgoraptor Scale Chest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidhunter_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gorgoraptor Scale Chest</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95197/therapsid-scale-gloves">
<img alt="Therapsid Scale Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_mail_raidhunter_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Therapsid Scale Gloves</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95189/belt-of-the-dying-diemetradon">
<img alt="Belt of the Dying Diemetradon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidhunter_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Dying Diemetradon</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95166/forzarras-last-meal">
<img alt="Forzarra's Last Meal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_179.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Forzarra's Last Meal</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c3" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>Galleon can be found in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=5805/valley-of-the-four-winds">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Valley of the Four Winds</span></a> and is a great source of early gear, since it can drop ilvl-496 armor, as well as accessories, it's definitely worth killing as soon as you get the chance.<br/>Below I'll list all the items from Galleon that you should look out for.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90437/hereditary-saurok-loop">
<img alt="Hereditary Saurok Loop" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hereditary Saurok Loop</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90432/hellriders-choker">
<img alt="Hellrider's Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hellrider's Choker</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90421/chain-of-unsiezed-skies">
<img alt="Chain of Unsiezed Skies" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidhunter_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chain of Unsiezed Skies</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90453/girdle-of-the-raging-rider">
<img alt="Girdle of the Raging Rider" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidhunter_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Girdle of the Raging Rider</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90444/treads-of-gentle-nudges">
<img alt="Treads of Gentle Nudges" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_mail_raidhunter_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Gentle Nudges</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90413/crest-of-the-grand-warband">
<img alt="Crest of the Grand Warband" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_dungeonmail_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crest of the Grand Warband</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c3" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops ilvl-496 Tier 14 pieces, as well as various ivl-483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a head start on your tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90906/treads-of-ardent-antagonism">
<img alt="Treads of Ardent Antagonism" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_mail_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Ardent Antagonism</span></a>, a decent early pair of boots.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="rare-mobs">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Rare Mobs</span></h3>There are tons of Rare mobs scattered around Pandaria, and each one has their own unique drop. Most of these are toys, cosmetics, or similar items, but a small handful can drop strong equipment that can be used for leveling or right as you reach level 90.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50787/arness-the-scale">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Arness the Scale</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90723/arnesss-scaled-leggings">
<img alt="Arness's Scaled Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_mail_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arness's Scaled Leggings</span></a>, ilvl 440 Legs.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50331/go-kan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Go-Kan</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90719/go-kans-golden-trousers">
<img alt="Go-Kan's Golden Trousers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_mail_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Go-Kan's Golden Trousers</span></a>, ilvl 440 Legs.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50782/sarnak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sarnak</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87650/fishsticker-crossbow">
<img alt="Fishsticker Crossbow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bow_2h_crossbow_cataclysm_b_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fishsticker Crossbow</span></a>, an ilvl 420 Crossbow.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c3" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Beast Mastery Hunters</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. Focus on starting to gain reputation with Shado-Pan Assault as soon as possible so that you can get an early <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95143/flankers-battletags">
<img alt="Flanker's Battletags" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flanker's Battletags</span></a>. As for what to get after that, it will depend on what items you've gotten from Celestials already. I would suggest simming your own optimal upgrade path for these valor items as they are costly.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
